<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>EcoMonitor | Consumo Inteligente</title>
    <!-- Bootstrap 5 CSS CDN -->
    <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.2/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        /* Paleta de Cores e Identidade Visual */
        :root {
            --eco-blue: #0d6efd; /* Confiança/Água */
            --eco-green: #198754; /* Sustentabilidade */
            --eco-yellow: #ffc107; /* Atenção/Energia */
            --eco-red: #dc3545; /* Alerta crítico */
        }
        
        body {
            background-color: #f8f9fa;
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
        }

        .header-custom {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--eco-blue), #0a58ca);
            color: white;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
        }

        .card-custom {
            border: none;
            border-radius: 12px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);
            transition: transform 0.2s ease-in-out;
        }

        /* Classes para a Engenharia Comportamental (Semáforo) */
        .status-green {
            background-color: #d1e7dd;
            border-left: 6px solid var(--eco-green);
            color: #0f5132;
        }
        
        .status-yellow {
            background-color: #fff3cd;
            border-left: 6px solid var(--eco-yellow);
            color: #664d03;
        }
        
        .status-red {
            background-color: #f8d7da;
            border-left: 6px solid var(--eco-red);
            color: #842029;
        }

        /* Transição de Telas SPA */
        .spa-screen {
            display: none;
            animation: fadeIn 0.4s ease-in-out;
        }
        .spa-screen.active {
            display: block;
        }

        @keyframes fadeIn {
            from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(10px); }
            to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <!-- Cabeçalho Principal -->
    <header class="header-custom py-3 mb-4">
        <div class="container d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center">
            <h1 class="h3 mb-0">🌱 EcoMonitor</h1>
            <span class="badge bg-light text-primary">Sorocaba-SP</span>
        </div>
    </header>

    <main class="container mb-5">
        
        <!-- TELA 1: Cadastro e Perfil -->
        <section id="screen-1" class="spa-screen active">
            <div class="row justify-content-center">
                <div class="col-md-8">
                    <div class="text-center mb-4">
                        <h2>Bem-vindo(a) ao seu Dashboard de Consumo</h2>
                        <p class="text-muted">Acompanhe seus gastos e descubra como pequenos hábitos geram grandes economias.</p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="card card-custom p-4">
                        <form id="ecoForm">
                            <h5 class="text-primary border-bottom pb-2 mb-4">1. Dados da Conta</h5>
                            
                            <div class="row mb-3">
                                <div class="col-md-6 mb-3">
                                    <label class="form-label fw-bold">Tipo de Serviço</label>
                                    <select class="form-select" id="serviceType" required>
                                        <option value="energy">Energia Elétrica (kWh)</option>
                                        <option value="water">Água (m³)</option>
                                    </select>
                                </div>
                                <div class="col-md-6 mb-3">
                                    <label class="form-label fw-bold">Mês de Referência</label>
                                    <input type="month" class="form-control" id="refMonth" required>
                                </div>
                            </div>

                            <div class="row mb-4">
                                <div class="col-md-6 mb-3">
                                    <label class="form-label fw-bold">Consumo (<span id="unitLabel">kWh</span>)</label>
                                    <input type="number" step="0.01" class="form-control" id="consumption" placeholder="Ex: 120" required>
                                </div>
                                <div class="col-md-6 mb-3">
                                    <label class="form-label fw-bold">Valor Total (R$)</label>
                                    <div class="input-group">
                                        <span class="input-group-text">R$</span>
                                        <input type="number" step="0.01" class="form-control" id="billTotal" placeholder="0,00" required>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>

                            <h5 class="text-primary border-bottom pb-2 mb-3">2. Perfil de Eletrodomésticos</h5>
                            <p class="small text-muted mb-3">Selecione o que você costuma usar regularmente nesta residência:</p>
                            
                            <div class="row mb-4">
                                <div class="col-sm-6 mb-2">
                                    <div class="form-check form-switch">
                                        <input class="form-check-input appliance-check" type="checkbox" value="shower" id="appShower">
                                        <label class="form-check-label" for="appShower">Chuveiro Elétrico</label>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <div class="col-sm-6 mb-2">
                                    <div class="form-check form-switch">
                                        <input class="form-check-input appliance-check" type="checkbox" value="washer" id="appWasher">
                                        <label class="form-check-label" for="appWasher">Máquina de Lavar</label>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <div class="col-sm-6 mb-2">
                                    <div class="form-check form-switch">
                                        <input class="form-check-input appliance-check" type="checkbox" value="iron" id="appIron">
                                        <label class="form-check-label" for="appIron">Ferro de Passar</label>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <div class="col-sm-6 mb-2">
                                    <div class="form-check form-switch">
                                        <input class="form-check-input appliance-check" type="checkbox" value="ac" id="appAC">
                                        <label class="form-check-label" for="appAC">Ar-condicionado</label>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>

                            <div class="d-grid gap-2 mt-4">
                                <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary btn-lg">Calcular e Analisar Métrica</button>
                            </div>
                        </form>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- TELA 2: Comparador e Engenharia Comportamental -->
        <section id="screen-2" class="spa-screen">
            <div class="row justify-content-center">
                <div class="col-md-10">
                    
                    <!-- Card de Feedback Principal (Semáforo) -->
                    <div id="feedbackCard" class="card card-custom p-4 mb-4 text-center">
                        <h2 id="feedbackTitle" class="fw-bold mb-2">Analisando...</h2>
                        <p id="feedbackSubtitle" class="lead mb-0">Aguarde os resultados.</p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="row mb-4">
                        <!-- Comparativo de Consumo -->
                        <div class="col-md-6 mb-3">
                            <div class="card card-custom h-100 p-4">
                                <h5 class="text-secondary">Comparativo Municipal</h5>
                                <div class="d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center mt-3">
                                    <div class="text-center">
                                        <p class="mb-1 text-muted">Seu Consumo</p>
                                        <h3 id="userConsDisplay" class="fw-bold text-primary">0</h3>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="text-center text-muted">vs</div>
                                    <div class="text-center">
                                        <p class="mb-1 text-muted">Média Sorocaba</p>
                                        <h3 id="cityConsDisplay" class="fw-bold">0</h3>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <div class="progress mt-3" style="height: 10px;">
                                    <div id="progressBar" class="progress-bar" role="progressbar" style="width: 0%"></div>
                                </div>
                                <p id="diffText" class="text-center mt-3 mb-0 fw-bold"></p>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <!-- Impacto no Bolso -->
                        <div class="col-md-6 mb-3">
                            <div class="card card-custom h-100 p-4 bg-light">
                                <h5 class="text-success"><span class="fs-4">💰</span> Impacto no Bolso</h5>
                                <p class="text-muted small">Oportunidades de economia mapeadas pelo seu perfil:</p>
                                <ul id="savingsList" class="list-group list-group-flush bg-transparent">
                                    <!-- Preenchido via JS -->
                                </ul>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Dicas Práticas de Engenharia Comportamental -->
                    <div class="card card-custom p-4 mb-4">
                        <h5 class="mb-3 text-dark">💡 Plano de Ação para sua Rotina</h5>
                        <ul id="tipsList" class="list-group list-group-flush list-group-numbered text-muted">
                            <!-- Preenchido via JS baseado na cor do semáforo -->
                        </ul>
                    </div>

                    <div class="text-center mt-4">
                        <button id="btnBack" class="btn btn-outline-secondary btn-lg px-5">Voltar e Registrar Novo Mês</button>
                    </div>

                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

    </main>

    <!-- Script de Funcionalidades -->
    <script src="script.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
